Package: TVFSurvFlow
Title: Standardized Framework for Survival Analysis with Time-Varying Features
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Capucine", "Labat-Berthier",
           email = "capucine.labat.berthier@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A standardized, user-friendly framework that wraps classical and
    machine-learning survival models behind a single interface, with optional
    support for time-varying features. Trains, evaluates, and compares Cox
    proportional hazards, penalized Cox (ridge/lasso/elastic net), random
    survival forests, gradient boosting, left-truncation-aware trees, DeepSurv,
    and DeepPAMM under a common workflow, with shared metrics (time-dependent
    ROC/AUC, Brier score, prediction error curves) and reporting. Extends the
    'satpred' package. Developed as a research project; see README for status
    and known limitations.
License: GPL-3
